; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - gold trend sleeve, MIDDLE setting (about 0.4 x Kelly on the 20-year Sharpe of 0.5). Daily stop at 4 x daily volatility.
; Rule (unchanged since chapter 93): hold gold while its daily close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days. Long only.
; No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; For the OANDA commodity CFD account (a separate sub-account; account leverage 1:100, gold margin 5%). Attach to an XAUUSD chart (H1).
; Numbers below: MT5 tester on OANDA's own data with the account's real leverage, JPY 3,000,000, measured on daily equity (chapter 105).
;   last 3 years, real ticks: +179% (+40% per year), drawdown 27%, best 12 months +147%, worst -6%. By year: 2024 +37%, 2025 +103%, 2026 -5%.
;   2007 - 2026: +413% (+9% per year), Sharpe 0.51, drawdown 59%, worst 12 months -33%. Seven losing years in a row in 2012-2018.
;   Pair with AMS_Sleeves_Index_Demo.set on the index account (half of the money each): last 3 years +155%, drawdown 14%, worst 12 months +15%.
